      "rationale": "The type of remediation is a useful axis to explain handling-time variation. However, this column asserts resolution actions the source text does not state. For CS-0001 (invoice correction) it produces 'bug_fix_or_hotfix' and for CS-0002 (session drop suspected SSO config) also 'bug_fix_or_hotfix' where the issue descriptions describe the problem, not the resolution taken. These are confident specifics unsupported by the request text, indicating some fabrication despite plausible category vocabulary."
